From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +000
Subject: [PATCH] HTSPVFS: include cstdint

HTSPVFS.h uses uint32_t and int64_t directly. Newer toolchains do not
guarantee these are available through unrelated transitive includes, so
include <cstdint> explicitly.

Upstream: Not submitted
Signed-off-by: suckbluefrog <suckbluefrog@proton.me>
---
 src/tvheadend/HTSPVFS.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/tvheadend/HTSPVFS.h b/src/tvheadend/HTSPVFS.h
--- a/src/tvheadend/HTSPVFS.h
+++ b/src/tvheadend/HTSPVFS.h
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
 
 #pragma once
 
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <memory>
 #include <string>
 
-- 
